# Car API HTTP Requests with Role-Based Access Control
# This file contains requests that demonstrate role-based access to the API
# Use these with Postman or other HTTP client tools

# IMPORTANT CSRF TOKEN HANDLING:
# The application uses CSRF protection with cookie-based tokens
# For any non-GET requests (POST, PUT, DELETE, PATCH), you need to:
# 1. First make a GET request to fetch the CSRF token (it will be in the response cookies as 'XSRF-TOKEN')
# 2. Include the token in the header of subsequent requests as 'X-XSRF-TOKEN'
# In Postman, you can use the Collection settings to automatically extract and use the token

### 1. Get All Cars (READ)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars
Authorization: Basic user user

### 2. Get Car by ID (READ)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars/1
Authorization: Basic user user

### 3. Create New Car (CREATE) - Admin/Superadmin only
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cars
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf_token}}

{
  "make": "Honda",
  "model": "Civic",
  "year": 2022,
  "color": "Silver",
  "price": 23000.00
}

### 4. Update Car (UPDATE) - Admin/Superadmin only
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/cars/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf_token}}

{
  "make": "Honda",
  "model": "Civic",
  "year": 2023,
  "color": "Black",
  "price": 24000.00
}

### 5. Delete Car (DELETE) - Admin/Superadmin only
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cars/2
Authorization: Basic admin admin
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf_token}}

### 6. Get System Stats - Superadmin only
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars/admin/stats
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin

### 7. Search Cars by Make (READ)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars/search/make/Toyota
Authorization: Basic user user

### 8. Get Cars by Price Range (READ)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars/search/price?min=20000&max=30000
Authorization: Basic user user

### 9. Bulk Delete Cars (DELETE) - Admin/Superadmin only
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cars/bulk
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf_token}}

[1, 3, 5]

### 10. Reset Car Price (PATCH) - Admin/Superadmin only
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/cars/1/reset-price?newPrice=22000
Authorization: Basic admin admin
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf_token}} 